@base = http://127.0.0.1:4000/api/v1
@sessionToken = paste-session-token-here
@adminToken = paste-private-admin-token-here

### Admin login (copy returned accessToken into adminToken above)
POST {{base}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"OrbitAdmin123!"}

### Create session (copy returned token above)
POST {{base}}/sessions

### Sign in as internal staff (requires sessionToken)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"staff","password":"OrbitStaff123!"}

### Sign out of internal staff
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Onboarding
PATCH {{base}}/sessions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"area":"Fitzroy","interests":["strength","mobility"],"formats":["mat","reformer"],"onboardingComplete":true}

### Fresh workouts
GET {{base}}/workouts?format=mat&limit=20

### Nearest reformer studios
GET {{base}}/studios?format=reformer&latitude=-37.798&longitude=144.978&radiusKm=50&sort=nearest

### Studio profile, instructors and referral code
GET {{base}}/studios/studio-melbourne

### Workout product tags
GET {{base}}/workouts/workout-mat

### Product bundles
GET {{base}}/shop/products?collection=bundles

### Set absolute quantity
PUT {{base}}/shop/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":"product-socks","variantId":"socks-s","quantity":2}

### Referral attribution
POST {{base}}/referrals/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code":"FITZROY-DEMO"}

### Demo quote
POST {{base}}/shop/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fulfillment":"warehouse-collect","source":"app","discountCode":"WELCOME15"}

### Demo checkout: retain the same key when retrying this order
POST {{base}}/shop/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-checkout-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"fulfillment":"warehouse-collect","source":"app","discountCode":"WELCOME15"}

### Personal demo orders
GET {{base}}/shop/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}

### Partner geo offer
GET {{base}}/offers?latitude=-37.798&longitude=144.978

### MoveActive admin overview
GET {{base}}/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Update sample studio
PATCH {{base}}/admin/studios/studio-melbourne
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"description":"Updated sample partner studio for internal playtesting."}

### Manage studio-led affiliation
POST {{base}}/admin/affiliations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"studioId":"studio-melbourne","instructorId":"instructor-ella"}
